Project Goal
To reduce waiting times and overcrowding in clinics and hospitals by enabling patients to book 
appointments, track queue status in real-time and receive digital notifications. Patients can schedule
appointments via the app, selecting preferred time slots and services. The app can send reminders and 
alerts when it's close to the patient's turn. Emergency cases, elderly patients and chronic illness 
follow-ups can be assisted immedietely. 

The target audience is patients in rural and urban communities, healthcare providers and government health
departments.The design is user-friendly interface with accessibility in mind and easy to use. It will reduce 
the time patients spend waiting in the clinics and hospitals.
